OL,3,GNEWSAThis City Is Ours stars reject
OL,4,A'glamourising crime' claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FStars of the hit Liverpool crime drama
OL,7,FThis City Is Ours have defended the
OL,8,Fseries against claims it shows the city
OL,9,Fin a negative light and glamourises a
OL,10,Flife of crime.
OL,12,FJames Nelson-Joyce, who plays Michael
OL,13,FKavanagh, and Jack McMullen, who plays
OL,14,FJamie Phelan, said the series was
OL,15,Ffundamentally a story about
OL,16,Frelationships and could take place in
OL,17,Fany big city.
OL,19,F"We're just talking about what does go
OL,20,Fon in life and families," Nelson-Joyce
OL,21,Ftold BBC Radio Merseyside's Tony Snell.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
