OL,3,GNEWSAThis City Is Ours stars reject
OL,4,A'glamourising crime' claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe show, which has been commissioned
OL,7,Ffor a third series, follows the
OL,8,Ffortunes of the fictional Phelan crime
OL,9,Ffamily, and is filmed across the city
OL,10,Fregion and Spain.
